{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>美國佐治亞州六旗樂園有人玩過山車從高處墮下身亡，另有多人受傷。</p><p></p><p>工作人員協助遊客離開過山車，沿樓梯返回地面。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.CNN.US.COASTER-0730_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026RiRI7osXEf1791850310.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>事發在當地周一下午，有目擊者稱涉事男子跟另一名兒童在遊玩「歌利亞」過山車期間，該男子突然脫離座位，從高處墮下，並三度撞倒其他車卡。</p><p></p><p>園區就事故向死者家屬致以慰問，並以尊重家屬私隱為由拒絕公開披露細節。警方正調查事故，暫時未知男子墮下原因。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.CNN.US.COASTER-0730_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/20268X1CXpfOIL1791850307.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-13T00:19:56.408608+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":174,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"},"published_at":"2026-10-13T00:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-13T03:58:26.040576+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-13T00:17:48.976872+00:00","content_hash":"fa319979d0ddcbf0716f237deb74bc1f28c187ca42419ce2a47c6ea38c6082c3","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null}